                       "paragraphIndex":  0,
                       "text":  "Chapter 2 - A Census of the Returned Exiles. These are the inhabitants of the province who returned from the captivity of the exiles, whom Nebuchadnezzar, king of Babylon, had carried away to Babylon, and who came back to Jerusalem and Judah, to their various cities",
