                       "label":  "63",
                       "number":  63,
                       "subVerseIndex":  0,
                       "paragraphNumber":  0,
                       "paragraphIndex":  0,
                       "text":  "The governor ordered them not to partake of the most holy foods until there should be a priest to consult the Urim and Thummim.",
